  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">고3 문과반</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">생명과학수업 4시간 중에 1시간을 독서 시간으로 운영하려고 합니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(독서 첫번째 시간)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">1. 과학동아 과월호 20권, 뉴튼 10권, 생명과학 관련 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">단행본 10권을 도서실에 대출함</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">2. 한 권씩을 고르게 했더니 단행본 10권만 남음</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; (잡지가 그림이 많고 글밥이 적어 덜 부담스러워함)</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">3. 30분간 독서하고 간단한 요약, 궁금한 점 등을 기록해서 제출</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">4. 이런 독서수업이 어땠는지 간단한 설문조사 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">5. 수업 마무리 단계에서 한 명씩 돌아가며 오늘 독서활동에 대한 느낌을 발표</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">좋은점</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과학잡지를 통해 이해하기 어려운 과학 이론을 잘 알게되었고 지식을 넓힐 수 있었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 집에서도 이런 시간 가질까 말까 했는데 이렇게 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시간 정도 시간을 내서 짤막하게 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 시끌벅적하니 얘기도 하면서 물어도 보면서 중심 내용을 잘 잡아 글을 쓰는데 힘들었던 점이 전혀 없었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 이렇게 하면 재미있을 것 같아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 마음껏 얘기하고 웃고 시간가는 줄도 모르게 수업을 즐겼다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 자유롭게 의사표현을 해서 좋았다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 마음껏 떠들 수 있고 책을 다 읽어야 한다는 부담감이 없어서 좋았다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 친구들과 이야기하면서 재밌게 활동할 수 있어서 좋았던 것 같다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 따분한 수업이 아닌 재미있는 책을 읽고 담화를 하였는데 재미있었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 책 읽을 시간이 없었는데 과학실에 와서 책을 읽고 느낀 점과 질문을 만들면서 애들이랑 얘기하면서 수업해서 잘 참여할 수 있었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 앞으로 이런 수업 계속해 주세요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">힘들었던 점</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주변이 시끄러워서 집중이 잘 안 되었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 시끄럽다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 돌아다닌다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">일단 긍정적인 부분이 많아서 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">매주 한 시간씩 운영하려고 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">질문 1. 과학동아나 뉴튼 등의 과학잡지를 이용하려고 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 책을 읽으면서</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 어떤 활동을 하면 좋을까요?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 아이디어 구합니다~</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"></span></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}